## Decisions

| # | Decision | Evidence |
|---|----------|----------|
| 1 | {decision} | {file or pattern observed} |

## Consequences
- {positive consequence}
- {constraint or trade-off}

## Compliance
Enforced via `.cursor/rules/200-architecture.mdc`
</output_schema_file_2>
